ia.indiatimes.com/photo/136146804.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/an-australian-family-discovered-a-5-foot-venomous-snake-inside-their-toilet-after-it-travelled-through-a-narrow-sewer-pipe-a-snake-catcher-said-he-had-never-encountered-such-a-rescue-in-his-career/articleshow/136146804.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/an-australian-family-discovered-a-5-foot-venomous-snake-inside-their-toilet-after-it-travelled-through-a-narrow-sewer-pipe-a-snake-catcher-said-he-had-never-encountered-such-a-rescue-in-his-career/articleshow/136146804.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T08:56:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136146847,imgsize-1510601.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Armed men hold 30 hostage in Colombia supermarket; 10 rescued]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136147326.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In Cartagena, Colombia, a distressing situation unfolded as armed assailants took at least 20 hostages in a supermarket following a botched armored cash van heist. The police swiftly secured the vicinity, facilitating the release of some hostages. Authorities reassured citizens of their commitment to ensure the safe return of all captives. Meanwhile, flight operations at Rafael Núñez Airport resumed soon after the crisis began.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/watch-armed-men-take-30-hostage-at-colombia-supermarket-after-failed-attempt-to-rob-cash-van-10-rescued/articleshow/136147326.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/watch-armed-men-take-30-hostage-at-colombia-supermarket-after-failed-attempt-to-rob-cash-van-10-rescued/articleshow/136147326.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T09:21:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136147326,imgsize-174018.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What is the Fifth Amendment, and why is Trump urging Jensen Huang not to invoke it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136146727.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-the-fifth-amendment-and-why-is-trump-urging-jensen-huang-not-to-invoke-it/articleshow/136146727.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-the-fifth-amendment-and-why-is-trump-urging-jensen-huang-not-to-invoke-it/articleshow/136146727.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T08:52:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136146771,imgsize-100798.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[6 missing after Cessna plane crashes off Mississippi coast in US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136146338.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A search operation is under way off Mississippi’s coast after a Cessna aircraft carrying six people, including two children, crashed near Horn Island on Tuesday. The US Coast Guard has deployed rescue teams and recovered aircraft debris, a life raft and three life jackets. However, no passengers had been located as of the latest update. The NTSB will lead the investigation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/2-children-among-6-feared-missing-after-aircraft-crashes-into-waters-off-mississippi/articleshow/136146338.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/2-children-among-6-feared-missing-after-aircraft-crashes-into-waters-off-mississippi/articleshow/136146338.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T08:26:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136146498,imgsize-1707039.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Two arrested after masked men break into Prince William and Kate’s country home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136145875.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/two-arrested-after-masked-men-break-into-prince-william-and-kate-middletons-country-home/articleshow/136145875.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/two-arrested-after-masked-men-break-into-prince-william-and-kate-middletons-country-home/articleshow/136145875.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T07:53:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136145906,imgsize-164380.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Israel govt formation: Eisenkot, Lieberman join hands in bid to oust Netanyahu]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136145374.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Gadi Eisenkot's Yashar party has formed a coalition pact with Avigdor Lieberman's right-wing Israel Our Home party. This alliance is pivotal as efforts to create a government without Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu intensify. The Knesset was sworn in without a new government after the recent election reduced Netanyahu's majority. Eisenkot aims to establish a government by December 6, with an extension option available.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-govt-formation-eisenkot-lieberman-seal-first-coalition-pact-as-rivals-step-up-push-to-oust-netanyahu/articleshow/136145374.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-govt-formation-eisenkot-lieberman-seal-first-coalition-pact-as-rivals-step-up-push-to-oust-netanyahu/articleshow/136145374.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T07:02:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136145405,imgsize-64688.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Flights delayed at Chicago O’Hare airport as ground radar system suffers outage]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136145242.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/flights-delayed-at-chicago-ohare-airport-as-ground-radar-system-suffers-outage/articleshow/136145242.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/flights-delayed-at-chicago-ohare-airport-as-ground-radar-system-suffers-outage/articleshow/136145242.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T06:52:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136145282,imgsize-128624.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[West Virginia town sues to save 12 historic buildings from demolition in national park]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136141391.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Thurmond, a historic railroad town in West Virginia, is in a legal battle agai