-stanford-to-work-with-open-ai-started-his-own-startup-and-then-sold-it-for-4-5-billion/articleshow/136141678.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T01:37:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136141681,imgsize-36636.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[High-profile Colorado attorney who set own house on fire and apologized to wife and children for domestic violence dies of accidental drug overdose]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136141519.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/high-profile-colorado-attorney-who-set-own-house-on-fire-and-apologized-to-wife-and-children-for-domestic-violence-dies-of-accidental-drug-overdose/articleshow/136141519.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/high-profile-colorado-attorney-who-set-own-house-on-fire-and-apologized-to-wife-and-children-for-domestic-violence-dies-of-accidental-drug-overdose/articleshow/136141519.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T01:13:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136141544,imgsize-57734.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sydney medical student identifies 5 relatives in forgotten 1965 film after social media appeal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136140889.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 1965 film uncovered in Melbourne became a bridge connecting a Sydney medical student to previously unknown relatives. This discovery showcased three generations of his family outside their residence in Mitcham. After British director Karen Walsh endeavored to uncover the family's identity, the medical student recognized his great-grandmother among the footage shared online. With the help of ABC Melbourne, the quest for family links successfully culminated.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-british-television-director-was-searching-for-an-unidentified-melbourne-family-seen-in-a-forgotten-1965-film-a-sydney-medical-student-recognised-five-relatives-after-spotting-the-footage-on-social-media/articleshow/136140889.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-british-television-director-was-searching-for-an-unidentified-melbourne-family-seen-in-a-forgotten-1965-film-a-sydney-medical-student-recognised-five-relatives-after-spotting-the-footage-on-social-media/articleshow/136140889.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T00:52:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136141370,imgsize-1554312.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sofia Hernandez Mejia's arrest by ICE from Seattle airport: Husband says he feels useless as a US citizen]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136141225.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sofia-hernandez-mejias-arrest-by-ice-from-seattle-airport-husband-says-he-feels-useless-as-a-us-citizen/articleshow/136141225.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sofia-hernandez-mejias-arrest-by-ice-from-seattle-airport-husband-says-he-feels-useless-as-a-us-citizen/articleshow/136141225.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T00:44:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136141278,imgsize-59702.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[WestJet ordered to pay Canadian couple $2,000 after 16-hour delay blamed on wind]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136140753.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After a grueling 16-hour delay, a Canadian couple finally made it to Vancouver, only to find themselves stuck overnight in Regina due to a missed connection. WestJet cited strong winds as the reason for the delay but could not substantiate their claim. Ultimately, the Civil Resolution Tribunal held the airline liable and awarded the couple $2,226.92 for their inconvenience, which included their legal expenses.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-couple-kevin-and-marie-isobel-fraser-landed-in-vancouver-nearly-16-hours-late-after-westjet-blamed-a-wind-event-in-minneapolis-and-a-bc-tribunal-has-now-ordered-the-airline-to-pay-them-2000/articleshow/136140753.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-couple-kevin-and-marie-isobel-fraser-landed-in-vancouver-nearly-16-hours-late-after-westjet-blamed-a-wind-event-in-minneapolis-and-a-bc-tribunal-has-now-ordered-the-airline-to-pay-them-2000/articleshow/136140753.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T00:17:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136140852,imgsize-1320581.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Colorado man freed after 27 years for infant's murder seeks $2m, but family calls claim a joke]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136140564.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Stephen Martinez has filed a $1.9 million claim for state compensation following his wrongful imprisonment of 27 years, a conviction now overturned. However, the family of the baby involved contests this request, deeming it inappropriate under the current circumstances. Under Colorado law, Martinez must demonstrate actual innocence to qualify for state compensation, and a judge will decide if he meets this necessary legal standard in a forthcoming ruling.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/colorado-man-stephen-martinez-freed-after-27-years-when-his-murder-conviction-over-an-infants-death-was-overturned-is-now-seeking-about-2-million-from-the-state-and-the-babys-family-calls-his-claim-a-joke/articleshow/136140564.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/colorado-man-stephen-martinez-freed-after-27-years-when-his-murder-conviction-over-an-infants-death-was-overturned-is-now-seeking-about-2-million-from-the-state-and-the-babys-family-calls-his-claim-a-joke/articleshow/136140564.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T00:08:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136140677,imgsize-1688636.cms"/></item></channel></rss>